    architecture: '```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n  O[Order Service] -->|reserve| INV[Inventory Service]\n  INV --> L[(Ledger per SKU-node)]\n  INV -->|StockChanged| K[Kafka]\n  K --> SRCH[Search/PDP]\n  K --> AN[Analytics]\n```',
