    architecture: '```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n  C[Client] --> GW[API gateway - token bucket check]\n  GW --> R[(Redis - atomic Lua refill and consume)]\n  GW -->|allow| Svc[Backend services]\n  GW -->|deny - 429 with Retry-After + quota headers| C\n  M[Metrics: throttle rate, remaining quota] --> GW\n```\n\n**Key components:**\n- Gateway filter evaluates the bucket before routing — sub-millisecond added cost\n- Redis + Lua gives one distributed truth; per-node counters always over-admit\n- 429 responses carry Retry-After and X-RateLimit-Remaining so well-behaved clients back off correctly',
